{
  "id": "18304",
  "key": "SFCC-186",
  "summary": "PDP – Product Image Gallery",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n\n**I want** to view multiple product images on the PDP,\n\n**so that** I can see the product from different angles and in full detail before deciding to buy.\n\n----\n\n**Image for reference (Figma leading):** \n\n![\"image-20260716-043856.png\"](image-20260716-043856.png)\n\n\n\nThe PDP displays a product image gallery sourced from SFCC BM. Images are managed at the colour variation level if there are multiple colours — switching colour updates the gallery without a full page reload. If there is only 1 colour - images are managed at the master product level.\n\nOn desktop the gallery renders as a stacked editorial layout (large hero followed by another large image, then supporting images in a 2x2 grid). On mobile the gallery renders as a full-width swipeable carousel with dot indicators.\n\nThe primary hero image is priority-loaded. A consistent aspect ratio is maintained across all images. Alt text is required on all images but that is covered by a separate user story [(SFCC-31 ](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-31))\n\nVideo content within the gallery is out of scope — see SFCC-188",
