      "body": "Good morning User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac - here it is: [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=40001999-5751&t=RLYfGF5XqPFlCXyG-4](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "email": "timothy.lavelle@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8/69afd82c-3275-4f1a-82c5-96388b537351/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-04T09:49:54.364+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-04T09:49:54.364+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14296",
      "body": "Apologies, I have had to rewrite the ACs / take out a few ACs as they belong to the component story, covered in [SFCC-731](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-731) . Also, on colour variants, still pending business examples, the ACs needed to be adjusted, to be consistent with the default gallery state.\n\nOld ACs copied below for reference:\n\n**-Desktop:h-**\n\n1. -Given a shopper clicks any image in the PDP on desktop, when the image is clicked, then a full-screen overlay opens with the gallery.-\n1. -Given a shopper clicks on the “Gallery” CTA on the PDP, when the CTA is clicked, then a full-screen overlay opens with the gallery.-\n1. -Given the overlay is open, when it renders, then the clicked image displays as the selected thumbnail and as a large image on the top of the page.-\n1. -Given there are multiple colour variations, then the variations are displayed on the left as swatches and the selected colour from the PDP is also pre-selected in the gallery.-\n1. -Given there are multiple colour variations, when the shopper selects another colour variation, then the gallery images are updated to match that colour variation without a full page reload.-\n1. -Given the overlay is open, when it renders, then a horizontal thumbnail strip displays all gallery images as small thumbnails with the active image highlighted.-\n1. -Given the overlay is open, when a shopper clicks a thumbnail, then the primary image updates to display the selected image.-\n1. -Given the overlay is open, when a shopper scrolls the primary image panel, then they can navigate sequentially through all gallery images.-\n1. -Given the overlay is open, when a shopper clicks the × button, then the overlay closes and focus returns to the PDP at the same scroll position.-\n\n**-Mobile:-**\n\n1. -Given a shopper clicks on the “Gallery” CTA on the PDP, then a full-screen overlay opens with the gallery.-\n1. -Given a shopper has opened the gallery, if applicable, then the colour variations are displayed as swatches at the top and the product images stacked below.-\n1. -Given a shopper has opened the gallery, when they want to see all the product images, then the shopper will need to scroll down the page.-\n1. -Given a shopper is on mobile, when they pinch on a gallery image, then pinch-to-zoom is supported.-\n1. -Given the overlay is open, when a shopper clicks the × button, then the overlay closes and focus returns to the PDP at the same scroll position.-\n\nCC: User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8 User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-09-04T12:00:37.242+1000",
      "updated": "2026-09-04T12:02:05.269+1000"
    }
  ]
}"}

