 colour variations are displayed as swatches at the top and the product images stacked below.-\n1. -Given a shopper has opened the gallery, when they want to see all the product images, then the shopper will need to scroll down the page.-\n1. -Given a shopper is on mobile, when they pinch on a gallery image, then pinch-to-zoom is supported.-\n1. -Given the overlay is open, when a shopper clicks the × button, then the overlay closes and focus returns to the PDP at the same scroll position.-\n\nCC: User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8 User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341",
